te-scope\">528</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.2.16</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἐξ ὅτου περ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ach.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">596</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀπ' ὅτευ</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">since</b>.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.7</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">45.18</span> </span> (Halic., <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">v B. C.</span>); so <span class=\"gk\">ἕως ὅτου</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">until..,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ev.Luc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.8</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">from what cause</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">671</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">639</span> </span>.</div></div>"}